              "stitch": "Crosses, checks and small squares from knitting charts. Good for bands and repeating rules.",
              "diamond": "Diamonds and rings. Good for dividers and band centres.",
              "mark": "Corners, bars, dots and triangles. Structural accents: registration corners, rules, list ends."
